  "description": "Relative sizes for .NET MAUI: a percentage of the parent, the window, the display or another element, in XAML or code.\nWidthRequest=\"{me:Relative 30}\" is 30% of the parent's width, and stays that way as the window is resized or the phone rotated. Works on any double property - WidthRequest, HeightRequest, FontSize, Spacing - with Min and Max to clamp it.",
  "iconFile": "me.png",
