  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First release.\n{me:Relative} and SetRelativeSize size a double property as a percentage of the parent (less its padding), the window, the main display, an element named with x:Reference, or the nearest ancestor of a type. Width, Height, Shorter and Longer pick the dimension; Min and Max clamp the result; Portrait and Landscape give a different percentage for each orientation of the window. To=Self keeps an aspect ratio, Offset gives calc(50% - 8), and RelativeSizing's attached properties let a Style carry a relative size. The value is recomputed whenever the reference changes size or the element moves in the tree.",
